Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,花几秒钟去喂鲁尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}for five seconds and feed Rooney.
