Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,破烂手机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that we're replacing for my birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 为了给你买新助听器\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Dude, I've already been working doubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经在加班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to try to get you a new hearing aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这副还能用\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm fine with this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我学东西主要就靠它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but this is my primary source of education.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 我之前没想到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, my God. I never thought about it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你都学了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let me see what your education has been getting you up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 这个娃娃还真是阴魂不散\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, my God, I cannot escape this doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.05,0:06:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 等等 等等 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Okay, wait, wait, wait. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心 这个我今晚没收了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Gross. This is staying with me for the rest of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.89,0:06:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 你… - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What? You… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么做 这是我在家唯一的消遣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can't do that. That's the only thing to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以做的事多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There's literally an entire world of things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 有两个小孩站在雨中 多有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look, two kids standing in the rain. That looks fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道他们是什么人 可能是连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They could be anybody. They could be serial killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Noodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.87,0:07:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈过这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.87,0:07:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你会试着去交新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You said you were gonna try to make new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,搬家对我们来说应该是全新的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This move is supposed to be a new start for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么着 如果你出去认识新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Tell you what, you don't have to unpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你就不用收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}or do anything tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或做其它任何事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}if you just go out there and try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还能拿回手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Give you your phone back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.05,0:07:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我出门去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay. I'll be outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 这样就行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Really, that was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.83,0:07:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是我们三周前买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We picked this up three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.95,0:07:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们把它带回家 开机后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But we took it home, and we turned it on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的眼睛是红色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and its eyes were red.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且感觉它不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And something's wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪 而且我想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was just weird. And I just thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,新款两周后就发售了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}with the new one coming out in two weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如还是把它退了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it would just be better for me to take this back, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}get it off my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.51,0:07:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, I'm just wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以退款吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}can I get my money back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Wes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 我想问下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Hi. - Hey, I was just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.23,0:08:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的退货怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What happens to returns like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,损坏得很严重的退货\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like, really damaged returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄回给卡斯兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, we send it back to Kaslan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And what do they do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能把它扔进垃圾压缩机里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Probably toss it, trash compactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 新款要发售了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know. New model's coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,两周后就没人在乎这个古董了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No one's gonna give a rat's ass about this thing in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们不会在意这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, they won't care if it doesn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.87,0:08:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有被退回去 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}on the truck, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我孩子生日就快到了 能给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, my kid's birthday is coming up. Can I have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.79,0:08:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有孩子了 - 是的 我有孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You've got a kid? - Yes, I've got a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的花季年华过得甜蜜高效 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I had a very productive sweet 16, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想知道的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If you really wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事只有你知我知\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It'll be our little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.43,0:08:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人不会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No one has to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那次你在仓库里上了苏珊一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just like that time you banged Susan in the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便问下 你妻子最近怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How's your wife, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以给我吗 给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Can I have it? Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I'm taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了 韦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There you go, Wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,代我向你妻子问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Say hi to your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Oh, my God. - Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Noodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么早就放学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还记得肖恩吗 - 你好 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Remember Shane? - Hey, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.39,0:09:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去准备晚饭 你饿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm… I'm just gonna make dinner. You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.27,0:09:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不饿 我要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. Uh, I'm gonna go hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.02,0:09:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟楼道那头的孩子们一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}with some kids down the hall, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 有谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Really, who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要走了 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Gotta go. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是四楼楼道的流浪汉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Some kind of fourth floor hallway hobo, or something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫安迪吧 刚搬来401的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Andy, right? You just moved into 401?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常看到你在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. I see you out here, like, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, uh, no, it's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有五个孪生兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I have, like, five twin brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮流出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}so we just take shifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还进不进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you comin' in or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll be right there, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So that's the mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,每周都要拖我回家吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She drags me over for dinner every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你想吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, listen, man, if you wanna have some dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来我家 这样我就能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you're welcome to join us, 'cause I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人支援 因为她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}really use the backup, 'cause she…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.55,0:10:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.59,0:10:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他惹事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Is he in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 麻烦大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. Lots of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.18,0:10:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直有人跟我们投诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We've been gettin' lots of complaints about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有小孩在这办派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}some kid out here throwing parties,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖毒品和啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}selling drugs and beer.
